WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:02.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:02.560 --> 02:03.920
Leyang Huanmeng Park

3
02:05.960 --> 02:06.800
Are you tired?

4
02:06.920 --> 02:07.520
No.

5
02:08.639 --> 02:09.770
Look at the pigeons.

6
02:09.800 --> 02:10.960
So many pigeons.

7
02:11.280 --> 02:11.720
Yeah.

8
02:11.720 --> 02:13.050
Do you want to feed them?

9
02:15.680 --> 02:18.079
You must be thirsty. Have some water later.

10
02:19.720 --> 02:20.440
Dad,

11
02:20.960 --> 02:22.320
is Mom not coming today?

12
02:24.320 --> 02:25.600
Mom has been busy.

13
02:26.000 --> 02:28.060
Dad will spend the day with you today.

14
02:28.720 --> 02:30.320
Are you not having fun today?

15
02:30.600 --> 02:31.400
I am.

16
02:33.400 --> 02:35.200
Dad will take you to eat some delicious cake later,

17
02:35.200 --> 02:35.840
okay?

18
02:36.000 --> 02:36.560
Okay.

19
02:41.560 --> 02:42.320
My car.

20
02:44.000 --> 02:45.280
Stop, my car.

21
02:49.480 --> 02:50.560
Nuannuan, come.

22
02:51.200 --> 02:52.120
Zhao Jia, what are you doing?

23
02:52.120 --> 02:53.200
What am I doing?

24
02:54.040 --> 02:54.760
Nuannuan, let's go.

25
02:54.760 --> 02:55.920
You're going too far, Zhao Jia.

26
02:55.920 --> 02:56.560
Who's going too far?

27
02:56.560 --> 02:58.320
You're the one who took the child away without a word.

28
02:58.320 --> 02:59.120
Nuannuan, come with Dad.

29
02:59.120 --> 03:00.520
You're hurting her. Let go.

30
03:00.520 --> 03:01.640
Let go. Nuannuan.

31
03:01.680 --> 03:03.000
You're hurting her.

32
03:03.040 --> 03:04.640
She's crying. She's crying.

33
03:05.920 --> 03:06.920
Come on, get in the car.

34
03:06.920 --> 03:08.000
Don't cry.

35
03:11.480 --> 03:12.280
Why are you being so unreasonable?

36
03:12.280 --> 03:13.120
I'm being unreasonable?

37
03:13.120 --> 03:14.000
Give her back to me.

38
03:14.000 --> 03:16.120
I carried her for ten months and risked my life to give birth to her.

39
03:16.120 --> 03:17.480
What right do you have to take her?

40
03:17.480 --> 03:19.040
I raised Nuannuan since she was little.

41
03:19.040 --> 03:20.200
Have you ever cared for her?

42
03:20.200 --> 03:21.480
Where were you when she needed her mom?

43
03:21.480 --> 03:22.480
I was working.

44
03:22.480 --> 03:23.760
I was making money for this family,

45
03:23.760 --> 03:24.760
working my life away for this family.

46
03:24.760 --> 03:26.040
Without me, could you drive a car like that

47
03:26.040 --> 03:27.200
or live in a nice house like that?

48
03:27.200 --> 03:28.880
With your little bit of money, could she go to a private school,

49
03:28.880 --> 03:29.680
Zhao Jia? Could she study abroad?

50
03:29.680 --> 03:30.520
Do you still think Nuannuan and I

51
03:30.520 --> 03:31.780
need that kind of life?

52
03:32.000 --> 03:32.520
My income

53
03:32.520 --> 03:33.960
can also give Nuannuan a life like that.

54
03:33.960 --> 03:35.240
You're the one who wants too much.

55
03:35.240 --> 03:36.240
I want too much?

56
03:36.240 --> 03:37.520
Why didn't you refuse when I gave it to you?

57
03:37.520 --> 03:39.040
That's why I've had enough of you.

58
03:39.040 --> 03:40.960
Do you know how suffocating you are?

59
03:40.960 --> 03:41.840
I really hate your

60
03:41.840 --> 03:43.760
condescending attitude, you know?

61
03:43.760 --> 03:44.079
Fine.

62
03:44.079 --> 03:46.940
I'm telling you, you're not taking the child today.

63
03:47.040 --> 03:48.480
Then let me tell you again.

64
03:48.480 --> 03:49.640
From this moment on,

65
03:49.640 --> 03:51.200
Nuannuan will not leave my side.

66
03:51.200 --> 03:53.130
Don't even think about taking her.

67
03:53.480 --> 03:54.320
You're crazy.

68
03:54.320 --> 03:55.920
Do you deserve to be a mother?

69
03:56.040 --> 03:57.520
Did you forget Nuannuan got hurt because of you?

70
03:57.520 --> 03:58.680
Nuannuan got hurt because of me?

71
03:58.680 --> 03:59.520
Do I deserve to be a mother?

72
03:59.520 --> 04:01.520
What, are you playing the good father now?

73
04:01.520 --> 04:03.840
If it weren't for you wanting a divorce for your mistress,

74
04:03.840 --> 04:05.360
if it weren't for you abandoning this family,

75
04:05.360 --> 04:07.080
would this family have fallen apart?

76
04:07.080 --> 04:08.680
Zhao Jia, are you crazy?

77
04:08.680 --> 04:11.410
How am I being unreasonable in front of Nuannuan?

78
04:14.600 --> 04:15.800
Nuannuan! Nuannuan!

79
04:16.959 --> 04:19.839
Nuannuan! Nuannuan! Nuannuan!

80
04:20.839 --> 04:21.680
Nuannuan!

81
04:21.959 --> 04:23.200
Nuannuan!

82
04:24.000 --> 04:25.040
Nuannuan!

83
04:27.520 --> 04:28.120
Cheng Fei.

84
04:28.680 --> 04:29.320
How is it?

85
04:29.480 --> 04:30.610
I'm looking for her.

86
04:34.560 --> 04:35.240
Here.

87
04:38.320 --> 04:38.840
There.

88
04:44.400 --> 04:45.040
Here.

89
04:48.040 --> 04:49.920
It's all your fault. Are you crazy?

90
04:49.920 --> 04:51.120
Why did you make the decision on your own?

91
04:51.120 --> 04:51.800
There are so many cars here.

92
04:51.800 --> 04:52.640
What if she gets hurt?

93
04:52.640 --> 04:53.800
Would Nuannuan have run away if you hadn't gone crazy?

94
04:53.800 --> 04:54.680
Who went crazy first?

95
04:54.680 --> 04:55.480
Who acted shamelessly first?

96
04:55.480 --> 04:56.240
Because of you. Enough.

97
04:56.240 --> 04:56.960
It's because of you.

98
04:56.960 --> 04:57.840
Enough.

99
05:00.520 --> 05:01.800
Stop it, both of you.

100
05:02.600 --> 05:05.330
The most important thing now is to find Nuannuan.

101
05:05.840 --> 05:07.480
Do we have cameras from other angles?

102
05:07.480 --> 05:09.040
These are the only ones at the park entrance.

103
05:09.040 --> 05:10.900
We didn't capture anything else.

104
05:12.240 --> 05:13.320
Let's split up and search.

105
05:13.320 --> 05:13.960
Split up.

106
05:17.360 --> 05:19.080
Did you see a little girl?

107
05:19.240 --> 05:21.440
Did a student from our school come back?

108
05:22.440 --> 05:23.120
Xixi's mom.

109
05:23.120 --> 05:23.840
Nuannuan's mom. Xixi.

110
05:23.840 --> 05:25.120
Did Nuannuan look for you today?

111
05:25.120 --> 05:26.280
Have you seen this child?

112
05:26.280 --> 05:26.720
No.

113
05:26.800 --> 05:28.460
Then I'll leave you my number.

114
05:28.960 --> 05:30.220
She took classes here.

115
05:30.240 --> 05:31.440
She has pigtails.

116
05:31.680 --> 05:32.159
No.

117
05:32.159 --> 05:33.220
I haven't seen her.

118
05:49.600 --> 05:52.000
Can we come out and play often in the future?

119
06:14.720 --> 06:16.040
Xiaolong, I found Nuannuan.

120
06:16.040 --> 06:18.100
She's at the campsite from last time.

121
06:20.040 --> 06:20.920
Nuannuan.

122
06:23.480 --> 06:25.920
Nuannuan, why are you here?

123
06:28.680 --> 06:29.680
Uncle.

124
06:30.920 --> 06:32.280
I don't want to go home.

125
06:36.000 --> 06:36.930
That's perfect.

126
06:39.159 --> 06:40.820
I don't want to go home either.

127
06:48.520 --> 06:50.159
The little bird's parents.

128
06:51.840 --> 06:53.370
Will they get a divorce too?

129
06:57.280 --> 06:58.600
Is it because of me

130
06:59.320 --> 07:01.120
that they fight so much?

131
07:02.600 --> 07:04.360
If I were cut in half,

132
07:05.480 --> 07:06.880
one half for each of them,

133
07:07.080 --> 07:09.280
would they stop fighting?

134
07:13.840 --> 07:14.440
Nuannuan.

135
07:16.520 --> 07:18.650
Mom and Dad fighting is their problem.

136
07:19.520 --> 07:20.650
It's not your fault.

137
07:21.200 --> 07:23.320
But I don't want them to get a divorce.

138
07:23.680 --> 07:24.540
I don't want to.

139
07:33.560 --> 07:35.620
Actually, parents getting divorced

140
07:37.720 --> 07:39.480
isn't as scary as you imagine.

141
07:50.159 --> 07:51.920
When I was your age,

142
07:54.320 --> 07:57.920
my parents also got divorced.

143
07:59.760 --> 08:01.560
I was also very scared back then.

144
08:02.920 --> 08:04.280
But later I realized

145
08:06.280 --> 08:07.740
it wasn't what I expected.

146
08:09.760 --> 08:10.840
They treated me

147
08:12.760 --> 08:14.160
even better than before.

148
08:15.320 --> 08:16.800
They never argued again.

149
08:17.400 --> 08:18.960
They spoke gently

150
08:19.920 --> 08:21.380
and joked with each other.

151
08:23.960 --> 08:25.480
On my birthday,

152
08:26.000 --> 08:27.730
they would pick me up together,

153
08:29.120 --> 08:30.520
buy me gifts,

154
08:31.160 --> 08:32.760
and take me out for good food.

155
08:35.320 --> 08:36.799
When I was sick,

156
08:37.640 --> 08:39.360
they would take care of me

157
08:40.960 --> 08:42.080
and stay with me.

158
08:47.600 --> 08:49.060
Great. Take another step.

159
08:50.280 --> 08:52.520
Will they still take you out to play?

160
08:55.800 --> 08:56.400
Yes.

161
08:57.520 --> 08:59.320
We went to many places together.

162
09:00.560 --> 09:02.220
We went to the amusement park,

163
09:02.600 --> 09:03.600
the zoo,

164
09:04.320 --> 09:06.880
and went hiking and swimming together.

165
09:08.040 --> 09:09.570
What about when you grow up?

166
09:10.360 --> 09:11.480
Is it the same?

167
09:13.640 --> 09:15.240
When you grow up, you'll find

168
09:17.560 --> 09:20.760
that many things will pass.

169
09:23.960 --> 09:27.000
The good, the bad,

170
09:28.120 --> 09:29.760
the happy, and the unhappy,

171
09:31.520 --> 09:32.580
they will all pass.

172
09:36.360 --> 09:37.480
We will be fine.

173
09:39.480 --> 09:40.610
Even if we are alone,

174
09:42.840 --> 09:43.720
we will be fine.

175
09:45.960 --> 09:47.000
Will we really?

176
09:50.760 --> 09:51.440
Yes.

177
10:33.200 --> 10:34.680
Finding Nuannuan that day

178
10:34.800 --> 10:36.000
was all thanks to you.

179
10:36.800 --> 10:37.480
Thank you.

180
10:37.960 --> 10:38.680
Cheng Fei.

181
10:41.280 --> 10:42.040
Let's talk.

182
10:49.640 --> 10:50.880
As your attorney,

183
10:50.880 --> 10:54.040
I really should have argued strongly with Xiaolong.

184
10:55.880 --> 10:57.040
But later I realized

185
10:58.240 --> 11:00.240
we both have a common client,

186
11:02.360 --> 11:03.290
who is Nuannuan.

187
11:06.000 --> 11:08.130
Her interests are the most important.

188
11:09.520 --> 11:10.240
Jiajia.

189
11:11.240 --> 11:13.000
The trial is tomorrow.

190
11:13.640 --> 11:14.400
Should we

191
11:15.400 --> 11:17.280
reconsider

192
11:18.440 --> 11:20.680
whether to keep fighting for custody?

193
11:27.640 --> 11:28.400
I know.

194
11:30.200 --> 11:32.160
Nuannuan is very important to you.

195
11:32.880 --> 11:36.160
But she has already run away from home once,

196
11:36.560 --> 11:38.420
which means she's in a lot of pain.

197
11:38.760 --> 11:40.240
When the trial starts tomorrow,

198
11:40.240 --> 11:41.120
forcing her

199
11:41.120 --> 11:43.360
to choose between you and her father

200
11:45.240 --> 11:47.520
is just too cruel.

201
11:48.960 --> 11:52.320
Nuannuan is my own flesh and blood.

202
11:55.640 --> 11:58.240
If one of us

203
11:58.240 --> 11:59.720
has to

204
12:00.480 --> 12:01.960
get hurt,

205
12:02.960 --> 12:04.120
it definitely has to be me.

206
12:04.120 --> 12:05.240
It must be me.

207
12:05.840 --> 12:06.560
So...

208
12:15.520 --> 12:16.360
What's wrong?

209
12:17.760 --> 12:18.840
Cheng Fei said

210
12:20.320 --> 12:22.160
he's giving up custody of Nuannuan.

211
12:22.160 --> 12:22.920
He wants to

212
12:23.240 --> 12:25.640
handle the divorce with me peacefully.

213
12:36.720 --> 12:38.200
Although a divorce decree ends

214
12:38.200 --> 12:39.730
the marital relationship,

215
12:40.080 --> 12:41.280
it does not sever

216
12:41.800 --> 12:44.530
the relationship between parents and children.

217
12:45.560 --> 12:46.600
You and Zhao Jia will always be

218
12:46.600 --> 12:47.960
Nuannuan's parents.

219
12:48.840 --> 12:50.200
As she grows up,

220
12:50.680 --> 12:52.480
you play an indispensable role.

221
12:55.080 --> 12:57.080
Please don't leave

222
12:57.480 --> 12:59.610
invisible scars in the child's heart.

223
13:42.320 --> 13:43.080
You're here.

224
13:45.760 --> 13:46.400
Xiaolong.

225
13:46.400 --> 13:47.200
Dad.

226
13:48.320 --> 13:50.850
There's something I want to talk to you about.

227
13:56.000 --> 13:57.040
My son is home.

228
13:57.400 --> 13:59.280
Look, I timed it perfectly.

229
13:59.440 --> 14:01.640
Hurry up and wash your hands for dinner.

230
14:03.520 --> 14:04.380
That's enough.

231
14:06.160 --> 14:07.120
Thank you, son.

232
14:10.280 --> 14:11.360
Have a taste.

233
14:11.560 --> 14:14.440
These are all your favorite dishes from childhood.

234
14:14.680 --> 14:16.480
See if they still taste the same.

235
14:17.440 --> 14:18.170
Thanks, Mom.

236
14:21.840 --> 14:22.600
How is it?

237
14:24.280 --> 14:24.960
Delicious.

238
14:25.680 --> 14:26.540
Have some more.

239
14:31.080 --> 14:31.800
Son.

240
14:32.680 --> 14:33.440
Well,

241
14:34.160 --> 14:35.560
I've thought it through.

242
14:36.120 --> 14:37.400
As for Li Guochen's signature,

243
14:37.400 --> 14:38.860
if he won't sign, let it be.

244
14:39.240 --> 14:40.400
Don't put yourself in a tough spot.

245
14:40.400 --> 14:41.640
I'll handle it myself.

246
14:41.640 --> 14:43.570
It just means waiting a bit longer.

247
14:44.040 --> 14:45.770
Actually, Dad called me today.

248
14:46.320 --> 14:49.240
He asked when I'd be free to take you

249
14:49.880 --> 14:51.760
to sign the paperwork with him.

250
15:08.160 --> 15:09.760
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

251
15:09.760 --> 15:10.520
No need.

252
15:12.920 --> 15:14.040
I don't need it.

253
15:15.120 --> 15:16.720
We're not going the same way.

254
15:17.280 --> 15:18.010
I'm leaving.

255
15:33.240 --> 15:34.900
Li Guochen is getting old too.

256
15:44.400 --> 15:45.400
No dispute over property.

257
15:45.400 --> 15:47.040
Child custody goes to the mother.

258
15:47.040 --> 15:48.720
The father has visitation rights.

259
15:48.720 --> 15:49.920
Any questions?

260
15:50.560 --> 15:51.400
No problem.

261
15:52.280 --> 15:57.360
Number 7092, please go to window 23.

262
15:57.360 --> 15:57.890
June 6th.

263
15:58.520 --> 16:03.640
Number 7093, please go to window 23.

264
16:04.760 --> 16:09.920
Number 7093, please go to window 23.

265
16:33.040 --> 16:34.000
Where are you going?

266
16:34.000 --> 16:34.680
To work.

267
16:35.560 --> 16:36.240
And you?

268
16:36.520 --> 16:37.160
Same.

269
16:45.920 --> 16:46.560
Zhao Jia.

270
16:47.760 --> 16:49.120
I sincerely hope

271
16:51.160 --> 16:52.560
you will have a good life.

272
16:56.640 --> 16:57.400
Me too.

273
16:59.240 --> 17:00.440
From now on,

274
17:01.640 --> 17:03.640
we should both have a new beginning.

275
17:06.640 --> 17:07.720
See you this weekend.

276
17:07.720 --> 17:08.920
See you this weekend.

277
17:30.880 --> 17:32.280
Here I come. Careful.

278
17:32.800 --> 17:34.240
Be careful.

279
17:34.240 --> 17:36.400
Little Nuannuan, the eagle is coming.

280
17:36.400 --> 17:37.640
Careful.

281
17:39.720 --> 17:41.040
Got you! Got you!

282
17:41.120 --> 17:42.760
Then I'll be the eagle this time.

283
17:42.760 --> 17:44.420
You be the hen and protect Mom.

284
17:47.280 --> 17:47.760
Okay.

285
17:48.080 --> 17:48.920
Get behind me.

286
17:52.760 --> 17:54.280
Are you ready?

287
17:54.440 --> 17:55.640
Ready.

288
18:03.360 --> 18:04.360
This is so nice.

289
18:10.280 --> 18:11.160
Xiaolong.

290
18:11.160 --> 18:12.400
You can't catch me.

291
18:15.760 --> 18:16.480
Thank you.

292
18:36.000 --> 18:37.440
Just cry if you want to.

293
18:37.840 --> 18:39.240
It's no big deal.

294
18:40.240 --> 18:41.000
Look.

295
18:42.320 --> 18:44.120
Even the popsicle is crying.

296
19:06.640 --> 19:07.520
Come on.

297
19:16.520 --> 19:17.600
If you get any inside information in the future...

298
19:17.600 --> 19:18.840
Just tell me.

299
19:20.200 --> 19:22.000
I know it's hard to get into that group.

300
19:22.000 --> 19:23.400
Can you put in a good word for me with the group leader?

301
19:23.400 --> 19:24.680
Given our relationship.

302
19:24.680 --> 19:25.740
Don't you trust me?

303
19:26.040 --> 19:26.760
Right.

304
19:26.960 --> 19:28.560
I'll treat you to a meal some other day.

305
19:28.560 --> 19:29.120
Okay.

306
19:32.920 --> 19:33.960
So rude.

307
19:45.960 --> 19:46.680
Huzi.

308
19:50.320 --> 19:51.200
Dali.

309
19:56.520 --> 19:57.560
Why are you back?

310
19:59.080 --> 20:00.800
How many years has it been since we last saw each other?

311
20:00.800 --> 20:01.640
Ten years.

312
20:01.640 --> 20:02.320
Exactly.

313
20:02.320 --> 20:03.160
Let's have a good drink.

314
20:03.160 --> 20:04.760
It's on me. We won't leave until we're drunk.

315
20:04.760 --> 20:05.240
Okay.

316
20:05.240 --> 20:06.570
Let's have some drinks.

317
20:07.720 --> 20:08.880
Give me that one.

318
20:09.560 --> 20:11.890
Let's have that one, the most stylish one.

319
20:12.480 --> 20:13.160
Great.

320
20:13.800 --> 20:14.660
Of course it is.

321
20:15.360 --> 20:16.360
Are you sure, bro?

322
20:16.720 --> 20:18.640
This bottle is 3,500.

323
20:20.080 --> 20:21.010
What do you mean?

324
20:21.960 --> 20:23.080
Are you looking down on us?

325
20:23.080 --> 20:24.320
I'm just reminding you.

326
20:24.320 --> 20:25.280
It's fine.

327
20:25.320 --> 20:25.780
Open it.

328
20:25.960 --> 20:26.720
Don't open this one.

329
20:26.720 --> 20:27.960
I have money.

330
20:27.960 --> 20:28.400
It's fine.

331
20:28.400 --> 20:30.000
Change it to the most expensive one.

332
20:30.000 --> 20:30.640
Okay.

333
20:32.520 --> 20:33.160
No, Dali.

334
20:33.160 --> 20:35.000
We don't need to do this.

335
20:36.000 --> 20:36.560
Boss.

336
20:37.560 --> 20:38.820
This bottle is 18,000.

337
20:39.120 --> 20:39.960
18,000?

338
20:40.920 --> 20:42.520
Is it the most expensive one?

339
20:44.480 --> 20:46.480
I thought this place was high-end.

340
20:46.760 --> 20:47.080
Open it.

341
20:47.080 --> 20:48.120
Don't open it.

342
20:48.160 --> 20:48.520
You...

343
20:48.520 --> 20:50.240
This bottle of wine will cost me my family's bathhouse.

344
20:50.240 --> 20:50.720
Dali, you don't have to.

345
20:50.720 --> 20:51.520
Swipe the card.

346
20:51.520 --> 20:53.250
How could I let you spend money?

347
20:55.360 --> 20:56.960
What's going on with you?

348
20:57.480 --> 20:58.760
How come you're so rich now?

349
20:58.760 --> 21:00.760
Did you get that money legally?

350
21:00.760 --> 21:01.320
Let me tell you.

351
21:01.320 --> 21:02.840
I'm running a law firm with a friend now.

352
21:02.840 --> 21:05.170
If you have any problems, you must tell me.

353
21:06.040 --> 21:07.520
Don't worry.

354
21:09.200 --> 21:11.360
My dad gave me this money.

355
21:14.000 --> 21:15.120
Did your mom get married again?

356
21:15.120 --> 21:16.380
What second marriage?

357
21:17.760 --> 21:20.000
My mom got cancer a few years after moving away.

358
21:20.000 --> 21:23.560
She borrowed from loan sharks but couldn't be cured, and passed away.

359
21:23.560 --> 21:25.360
Later, I became a loan shark too.

360
21:26.080 --> 21:27.940
You... well, aren't you still...

361
21:28.000 --> 21:29.200
That's all in the past.

362
21:29.200 --> 21:30.160
I quit a long time ago.

363
21:30.160 --> 21:31.240
Don't worry.

364
21:31.480 --> 21:34.240
Then what did you mean by 'dad'?

365
21:36.560 --> 21:37.640
Growing up,

366
21:37.640 --> 21:39.280
my mom always told me my dad was dead.

367
21:39.280 --> 21:40.480
I told you about this.

368
21:41.000 --> 21:42.130
I never believed it.

369
21:42.200 --> 21:44.000
I always felt he was still alive.

370
21:44.600 --> 21:47.320
A while ago, an old man came looking for me.

371
21:48.480 --> 21:49.920
He said he's my biological father

372
21:49.920 --> 21:51.580
and wanted to acknowledge me.

373
21:51.600 --> 21:52.920
I... I never thought I was...

374
21:52.920 --> 21:54.240
I'm a rich kid.

375
21:55.080 --> 21:56.940
Tell me, isn't my dad impressive?

376
21:59.000 --> 22:00.320
You watch too much TV.

377
22:00.320 --> 22:02.040
Are you the youngest son of a chaebol?

378
22:02.040 --> 22:03.280
A rich kid?

379
22:07.840 --> 22:08.720
Dali, you...

380
22:09.840 --> 22:11.300
Are you telling the truth?

381
22:11.440 --> 22:11.680
When I did

382
22:11.680 --> 22:12.800
the DNA test,

383
22:12.800 --> 22:14.200
I was so nervous.

384
22:14.560 --> 22:16.320
I was afraid it wasn't true.

385
22:18.680 --> 22:19.120
Yeah.

386
22:20.240 --> 22:22.880
I, Dali, am completely back this time.

387
22:23.160 --> 22:24.680
You're doing great now.

388
22:25.000 --> 22:26.440
Gel in your hair,

389
22:26.440 --> 22:27.960
and this little chain is really nice.

390
22:27.960 --> 22:28.680
Hermès.

391
22:28.680 --> 22:29.520
What about this?

392
22:29.520 --> 22:30.380
Constantin...

393
22:30.440 --> 22:31.080
Vacheron.

394
22:31.240 --> 22:31.770
Zombies?

395
22:33.080 --> 22:33.920
Huzi,

396
22:34.080 --> 22:35.480
let's get rich together.

397
22:35.880 --> 22:36.720
Getting rich sounds good.

398
22:36.720 --> 22:37.280
Right?

399
22:37.680 --> 22:38.280
Cheers.

400
22:47.760 --> 22:49.440
Beautiful lady,

401
22:49.440 --> 22:51.300
did you leave the door open for me?

402
22:54.560 --> 22:56.020
Does your back hurt again?

403
22:56.040 --> 22:57.720
Don't keep using these patches if your back hurts.

404
22:57.720 --> 22:59.680
Why don't we go to the hospital and get it checked?

405
22:59.680 --> 23:01.360
What? It's an old problem.

406
23:01.360 --> 23:02.520
Why waste money on that?

407
23:02.520 --> 23:04.240
But I have money.

408
23:04.360 --> 23:06.240
The law firm pays me a salary,

409
23:06.560 --> 23:07.890
and I also trade stocks.

410
23:07.920 --> 23:09.480
Come on, with the little money you have,

411
23:09.480 --> 23:10.640
you should save it

412
23:11.400 --> 23:12.680
to get a wife first.

413
23:15.840 --> 23:16.400
What are you doing?

414
23:16.400 --> 23:19.000
Where did you go drinking? You reek of alcohol.

415
23:19.400 --> 23:20.240
You know who,

416
23:21.120 --> 23:21.600
Dali.

417
23:22.040 --> 23:22.720
Who?

418
23:23.040 --> 23:23.880
Dali.

419
23:25.280 --> 23:27.080
Hasn't he been out of town for years?

420
23:27.080 --> 23:27.720
Yeah.

421
23:28.680 --> 23:31.520
Didn't he live with his mom since he was a kid?

422
23:32.120 --> 23:34.780
Then his biological father suddenly showed up.

423
23:35.240 --> 23:36.480
And his biological father

424
23:36.480 --> 23:38.120
is a super rich

425
23:38.120 --> 23:38.760
big boss.

426
23:39.320 --> 23:40.280
What?

427
23:41.200 --> 23:42.200
Now,

428
23:42.440 --> 23:44.240
I have every reason to suspect

429
23:45.280 --> 23:46.360
that my father

430
23:46.920 --> 23:49.680
might also be a hidden...

431
23:50.120 --> 23:51.080
You had a few drinks

432
23:51.080 --> 23:52.940
and now you're talking nonsense.

433
23:54.360 --> 23:56.160
Give me that hot water bottle,

434
23:56.480 --> 23:57.560
and go to sleep.

435
23:57.560 --> 23:58.280
Got it.

436
23:58.920 --> 23:59.600
You don't need to hold it.

437
23:59.600 --> 24:00.080
Give it to me.

438
24:00.080 --> 24:00.920
You're not feeling well. Let me do it.

439
24:00.920 --> 24:01.800
I'll do it myself.

440
24:01.800 --> 24:02.920
Come on. Is it here?

441
24:04.120 --> 24:04.800
Here?

442
24:05.320 --> 24:06.480
A little lower.

443
24:06.480 --> 24:08.480
Okay, okay. Don't touch it. It's hot.

444
24:08.480 --> 24:09.960
A little higher.

445
24:18.920 --> 24:19.920
I'm telling you, with me here,

446
24:19.920 --> 24:21.200
our law firm is bound to win.

447
24:21.200 --> 24:22.480
We'll definitely win the championship.

448
24:22.480 --> 24:23.920
Cows are flying in the sky,

449
24:23.920 --> 24:25.160
because Brother Hu is blowing hot air on the ground.

450
24:25.160 --> 24:26.480
What am I bragging about?

451
24:26.480 --> 24:29.240
When I was a kid, I was known as the Badminton King of Heping District.

452
24:29.240 --> 24:30.080
Really?

453
24:30.080 --> 24:31.840
I almost made it to the district team when I was a kid.

454
24:31.840 --> 24:33.520
You didn't even make the district team?

455
24:33.520 --> 24:34.960
Okay, I know your level now.

456
24:34.960 --> 24:37.360
He's equivalent to my hometown township's

457
24:37.360 --> 24:37.960
middle-lower level.

458
24:37.960 --> 24:39.360
My district is huge.

459
24:39.360 --> 24:39.920
Lower-middle.

460
24:39.920 --> 24:41.050
What lower-middle?

461
24:41.920 --> 24:42.680
You're quite agile.

462
24:42.680 --> 24:43.360
Longnv.

463
24:44.520 --> 24:45.480
Class monitor.

464
24:45.920 --> 24:46.560
I'm number 24.

465
24:46.560 --> 24:47.520
What number are you guys?

466
24:47.520 --> 24:48.440
We are

467
24:48.440 --> 24:49.200
on the 7th.

468
24:49.200 --> 24:50.920
Who are you playing against on the 7th?

469
24:50.920 --> 24:51.680
Who is it?

470
25:10.800 --> 25:12.200
Since your back is bad,

471
25:12.200 --> 25:13.520
we'll give you a three-point head start,

472
25:13.520 --> 25:14.880
so you can't say we're bullying you.

473
25:14.880 --> 25:16.120
Can you stop showing off?

474
25:16.120 --> 25:17.560
We don't need your head start.

475
25:17.560 --> 25:18.920
Mr. Li, let's give them ten points,

476
25:18.920 --> 25:20.120
so they don't lose too badly.

477
25:20.120 --> 25:21.840
It's fine. It's good that someone is giving away points.

478
25:21.840 --> 25:23.040
Just don't regret it.

479
25:24.600 --> 25:26.000
Both players, get ready.

480
25:32.440 --> 25:33.040
Nice shot!

481
25:34.280 --> 25:35.140
Come on, Uncle!

482
25:38.040 --> 25:39.120
Beautiful!

483
25:40.000 --> 25:40.600
Awesome!

484
25:41.560 --> 25:42.890
There you go. Good shot.

485
25:57.800 --> 25:59.040
Good shot!

486
26:02.240 --> 26:03.440
Good shot, Lawyer Li.

487
26:07.200 --> 26:08.320
Nice!

488
26:18.400 --> 26:18.960
Uncle.

489
26:19.280 --> 26:20.810
Where is your Feather King?

490
26:21.280 --> 26:22.120
No, no, wait a minute.

491
26:22.120 --> 26:23.320
Why are you guys so excited?

492
26:23.320 --> 26:24.280
Referee, you saw it, right?

493
26:24.280 --> 26:25.920
I gave them a three-point head start at the beginning.

494
26:25.920 --> 26:26.640
This is against the rules.

495
26:26.640 --> 26:28.480
You guys played well.

496
26:28.840 --> 26:29.320
You played well.

497
26:29.320 --> 26:31.440
I gave you a three-point head start at the beginning, didn't I?

498
26:31.440 --> 26:33.400
Don't make a fool of yourself.

499
26:33.400 --> 26:34.680
No, it was just...

500
26:34.680 --> 26:35.840
Accept your defeat.

501
26:35.840 --> 26:37.880
You insisted on giving them a handicap.

502
26:37.880 --> 26:38.480
No, I...

503
26:39.640 --> 26:40.640
Drink some water.

504
26:41.680 --> 26:42.880
I am the Badminton King.

505
26:42.880 --> 26:44.040
Are you the Badminton King?

506
26:44.040 --> 26:45.000
I am the Badminton King.

507
26:45.000 --> 26:46.930
I am the King of Kings in badminton.

508
26:53.400 --> 26:54.240
Let's get the car.

509
26:54.240 --> 26:55.600
We'll use our car to hit his car.

510
26:55.600 --> 26:57.400
Go hit your brother Beihu's car.

511
26:58.920 --> 26:59.680
Does it look like a big tiger?

512
26:59.680 --> 27:00.360
Lao Tian.

513
27:00.560 --> 27:02.280
Stop playing and call everyone to eat.

514
27:02.280 --> 27:02.760
Sister-in-law.

515
27:02.760 --> 27:03.800
Thank you, sister-in-law.

516
27:03.800 --> 27:04.800
Why don't you take a rest?

517
27:04.800 --> 27:05.520
Stop, stop cooking.

518
27:05.520 --> 27:06.520
Just one last dish of fried pork slices left.

519
27:06.520 --> 27:07.040
Coming right up.

520
27:07.040 --> 27:08.640
Don't stop your sister-in-law.

521
27:08.640 --> 27:10.400
She hasn't made this dish in a long time.

522
27:10.400 --> 27:12.280
If it weren't for you guys, I wouldn't get to eat it.

523
27:12.280 --> 27:13.920
Who told you to have high blood pressure, blood sugar, and cholesterol?

524
27:13.920 --> 27:15.080
You can only have one bite later.

525
27:15.080 --> 27:15.720
I'm telling you.

526
27:15.720 --> 27:17.280
Don't worry, Sister-in-law. We'll keep an eye on him.

527
27:17.280 --> 27:18.040
If you ask me,

528
27:18.040 --> 27:19.680
Old Class Monitor, you really need to take care of your health.

529
27:19.680 --> 27:20.680
Stop staying up late.

530
27:20.680 --> 27:22.040
Don't work yourself to death.

531
27:22.040 --> 27:22.880
Our bodies now

532
27:22.880 --> 27:24.600
aren't like they were in college, right?

533
27:24.600 --> 27:25.040
Right.

534
27:25.040 --> 27:26.720
I feel like back when I was taking the bar exam,

535
27:26.720 --> 27:28.600
I stayed up night after night.

536
27:29.360 --> 27:30.360
Did she tell you guys?

537
27:30.360 --> 27:32.200
Her bar exam story is so annoying.

538
27:32.200 --> 27:33.860
She passed it on her first try.

539
27:34.320 --> 27:35.960
It's not worth mentioning.

540
27:36.040 --> 27:37.000
It's all luck.

541
27:37.160 --> 27:38.760
Excellent since childhood.

542
27:39.440 --> 27:40.400
You guys probably don't know.

543
27:40.400 --> 27:42.720
The old monitor got a really high score on the bar exam.

544
27:42.720 --> 27:43.920
You should ask him for advice.

545
27:43.920 --> 27:46.040
I took it three times.

546
27:46.200 --> 27:49.040
By the end, even the questions recognized me.

547
27:49.240 --> 27:51.600
Old monitor, you took it that many times too?

548
27:51.600 --> 27:53.200
I've taken it five times now,

549
27:53.440 --> 27:54.360
but I still haven't passed.

550
27:54.360 --> 27:55.720
Is this something to be proud of?

551
27:55.720 --> 27:56.920
Why are you telling everyone?

552
27:56.920 --> 27:58.800
Three or five times is nothing.

553
27:58.800 --> 28:01.280
People like us just get braver with every setback.

554
28:01.280 --> 28:01.920
To sum up,

555
28:01.920 --> 28:04.760
I just slowly grew up

556
28:04.960 --> 28:06.280
through setbacks and failures.

557
28:06.280 --> 28:07.120
Later on, I even...

558
28:07.120 --> 28:09.400
I even wrote a bar exam guidebook myself.

559
28:09.400 --> 28:10.000
Wanna see?

560
28:11.720 --> 28:13.250
Fried pork slices are here!

561
28:13.480 --> 28:14.240
Come on.

562
28:14.240 --> 28:15.080
Come on, eat up.

563
28:15.080 --> 28:16.560
I don't know if it suits your taste.

564
28:16.560 --> 28:18.040
It's perfect.

565
28:18.800 --> 28:20.730
You two are perfect for each other.

566
28:21.040 --> 28:23.120
You have to return it to me.

567
28:23.200 --> 28:24.520
Luo Zhi, let me tell you.

568
28:24.520 --> 28:26.520
This isn't just a bar exam guidebook.

569
28:26.520 --> 28:28.280
It's my old monitor's blood, sweat, and tears.

570
28:28.280 --> 28:29.920
It's my life.

571
28:30.000 --> 28:31.000
Look at his white hair.

572
28:31.000 --> 28:32.040
It's from staying up late back then.

573
28:32.040 --> 28:33.600
Come on, let's eat.

574
28:35.680 --> 28:36.610
You have guests.

575
28:38.680 --> 28:39.200
Grandma Feng.

576
28:39.200 --> 28:40.480
Is Lawyer Tian here?

577
28:40.920 --> 28:41.560
Old Tian.

578
28:42.040 --> 28:42.720
Lawyer Tian.

579
28:42.720 --> 28:43.080
Grandma.

580
28:43.080 --> 28:45.280
Xiaoxue has locked herself

581
28:45.440 --> 28:47.560
in her room for a long time.

582
28:47.560 --> 28:50.560
I'm worried something might have happened to her.

583
28:50.600 --> 28:51.960
Did anyone answer when you knocked?

584
28:51.960 --> 28:53.290
No, Xiaoxue can't hear.

585
28:53.560 --> 28:54.560
Let's go take a look.

586
28:54.560 --> 28:54.960
Hurry.

587
28:54.960 --> 28:55.720
Go.

588
29:04.640 --> 29:05.240
Be careful.

589
29:05.240 --> 29:05.800
Child.

590
29:08.760 --> 29:09.520
Xiaoxue.

591
29:10.040 --> 29:10.760
Save her. Hurry.

592
29:10.760 --> 29:11.120
Hurry.

593
29:11.120 --> 29:12.400
I'll make a call. Get the car.

594
29:12.400 --> 29:13.040
Lift her up.

595
29:13.040 --> 29:13.760
Slow down.

596
29:13.760 --> 29:14.920
Hold her legs. Legs.

597
29:14.960 --> 29:16.040
No, I didn't get a good grip.

598
29:16.040 --> 29:17.520
Okay. Let's go. Slowly.

599
29:18.480 --> 29:19.000
Grandma.

600
29:19.000 --> 29:19.840
Don't worry.

601
29:32.200 --> 29:33.920
Doctor, how is the child?

602
29:33.920 --> 29:35.320
She took an overdose of sleeping pills.

603
29:35.320 --> 29:37.280
After gastric lavage, she is temporarily out of danger.

604
29:37.280 --> 29:39.040
But you still need to keep a close eye on her.

605
29:39.040 --> 29:39.600
Grandma.

606
29:39.600 --> 29:41.320
It's good that she's fine.

607
29:41.520 --> 29:43.920
Why do you think Xiaoxue suddenly took things so hard?

608
29:43.920 --> 29:45.200
Did something happen?

609
29:45.520 --> 29:46.560
I don't know.

610
29:48.080 --> 29:49.000
What happened?

611
29:49.840 --> 29:50.560
Grandma.

612
29:51.280 --> 29:51.920
Xiaodong.

613
29:51.920 --> 29:52.780
How is Xiaoxue?

614
29:53.480 --> 29:55.740
The doctor said she's just out of danger.

615
29:55.760 --> 29:56.720
It's all my fault.

616
29:56.720 --> 29:58.580
I shouldn't have argued with her.

617
29:59.160 --> 30:01.320
Why did you argue?

618
30:01.320 --> 30:03.380
I lost my temper and broke up with her.

619
30:03.400 --> 30:06.600
But I really didn't expect her to do something so foolish.

620
30:06.680 --> 30:07.520
It's all my fault.

621
30:07.520 --> 30:08.000
Child.

622
30:08.000 --> 30:09.600
Don't be like this.

623
30:09.720 --> 30:11.320
How could this be your fault?

624
30:11.920 --> 30:12.720
The patient just woke up.

625
30:12.720 --> 30:13.650
Please be quiet.

626
30:14.480 --> 30:15.280
You're awake.

627
30:27.480 --> 30:28.040
Xiaoxue.

628
30:28.760 --> 30:29.760
It's me, Weidong.

629
30:30.760 --> 30:31.520
I was wrong.

630
30:32.040 --> 30:33.200
Let's not break up,

631
30:33.200 --> 30:33.920
okay?

632
30:33.920 --> 30:35.120
I'll never mention breaking up again.

633
30:35.120 --> 30:35.920
Don't move around.

634
30:35.920 --> 30:36.920
You're on an IV.

635
30:36.920 --> 30:37.920
I know, I know.

636
30:37.920 --> 30:39.400
You're just mad at me, right?

637
30:39.400 --> 30:40.560
We'll never be apart again.

638
30:40.560 --> 30:42.160
All right, save it for tomorrow.

639
30:42.160 --> 30:42.960
Let the patient get some rest first.

640
30:42.960 --> 30:43.720
Okay.

641
30:43.720 --> 30:44.600
I'm sorry.

642
30:44.760 --> 30:46.020
This is my girlfriend.

643
30:46.760 --> 30:47.800
We had a fight.

644
30:47.800 --> 30:49.040
And she just...

645
30:52.480 --> 30:56.240
Did Feng Xue really try to kill herself over a breakup?

646
30:56.240 --> 30:58.320
Why do I feel like something's off?

647
30:58.520 --> 31:00.120
From what her grandmother said,

648
31:00.120 --> 31:02.040
they definitely had a conflict.

649
31:02.760 --> 31:05.920
Don't you guys think Feng Xue is really afraid of him

650
31:05.920 --> 31:07.520
and strongly resisting him?

651
31:07.560 --> 31:08.840
The director is right.

652
31:09.120 --> 31:10.920
What Feng Xue just said was,

653
31:11.960 --> 31:13.820
"Go away. I don't want to see you."

654
31:14.720 --> 31:15.760
How do you know?

655
31:16.080 --> 31:17.280
I know sign language.

656
31:17.920 --> 31:19.280
You know sign language?

657
31:19.760 --> 31:21.020
That's a hidden skill.

658
31:21.080 --> 31:22.280
When did you learn it?

659
31:22.280 --> 31:24.080
I've known it since I was a kid.

660
31:24.640 --> 31:25.840
Since you were a kid?

661
31:25.960 --> 31:28.040
That's a pretty unique skill to have.

662
31:28.520 --> 31:30.560
My parents are deaf.

663
31:34.400 --> 31:35.040
It's fine.

664
31:35.920 --> 31:38.920
Actually, they're no different from hearing people.

665
31:39.760 --> 31:42.440
They are very willing to communicate with others,

666
31:42.440 --> 31:43.840
hope to be understood,

667
31:44.200 --> 31:45.840
and are willing to understand others.

668
31:45.840 --> 31:48.170
Some deaf people even learn lip-reading.

669
31:48.680 --> 31:50.600
But that Wei Dong just now,

670
31:51.040 --> 31:53.080
he was just talking to himself,

671
31:53.080 --> 31:55.720
completely ignoring the fact that Feng Xue couldn't hear.

672
31:55.720 --> 31:57.600
Right, it didn't seem like a conversation.

673
31:57.600 --> 32:00.040
It was like he was just talking to himself.

674
32:00.040 --> 32:00.840
Director,

675
32:01.320 --> 32:02.520
I don't think Feng Xue

676
32:03.000 --> 32:04.600
tried to commit suicide over a relationship.

677
32:04.600 --> 32:06.040
I have the same feeling.

678
32:06.560 --> 32:08.760
But why does it seem like her grandmother

679
32:08.760 --> 32:10.960
really trusts this Wei Dong?

680
32:11.040 --> 32:13.000
How about this? In the next couple of days,

681
32:13.000 --> 32:15.040
let's find a chance to distract her grandmother

682
32:15.040 --> 32:17.280
and talk to Xiaoxue alone to understand the situation.

683
32:17.280 --> 32:17.840
Okay.

684
32:18.360 --> 32:20.240
Luo Zhi, you come with me.

685
32:20.920 --> 32:21.520
Okay.

686
32:31.240 --> 32:32.760
Sorry, Chairman Wan.

687
32:35.080 --> 32:35.880
This must be

688
32:35.880 --> 32:38.480
Mr. Wan Jr., who just returned from out of town.

689
32:38.720 --> 32:40.180
What a handsome young man.

690
32:40.240 --> 32:41.200
Hello.

691
32:41.320 --> 32:42.120
Hello.

692
32:43.000 --> 32:44.320
Come, have a seat, Attorney Li.

693
32:44.320 --> 32:45.160
Have a seat.

694
32:45.440 --> 32:46.200
Ali,

695
32:46.200 --> 32:47.800
let me introduce you.

696
32:47.800 --> 32:51.080
These two are senior partners at Honghu Law Firm,

697
32:51.240 --> 32:53.880
and our company's long-term legal advisors.

698
32:54.360 --> 32:55.760
With them around,

699
32:56.040 --> 32:57.440
I worry a lot less.

700
32:58.800 --> 32:59.960
You two attorneys,

701
33:00.320 --> 33:01.850
it's a pleasure to meet you.

702
33:02.080 --> 33:04.160
I look forward to working with you.

703
33:04.280 --> 33:05.810
Allow me to toast you first.

704
33:06.560 --> 33:07.400
Attorney Li.

705
33:08.280 --> 33:09.040
Sorry, Mr. Wan Jr.

706
33:09.040 --> 33:11.280
I don't drink.

707
33:11.280 --> 33:12.960
I'll toast with water instead.

708
33:12.960 --> 33:14.040
Please, do me the honor,

709
33:14.040 --> 33:14.770
Attorney Li.

710
33:15.040 --> 33:16.000
Just have a sip.

711
33:16.000 --> 33:18.330
Even just touching it to your lips is fine.

712
33:20.120 --> 33:20.960
Ali,

713
33:20.960 --> 33:23.720
Attorney Li never drinks.

714
33:25.560 --> 33:26.240
Feel free.

715
33:28.360 --> 33:29.090
Lawyer Shen.

716
33:32.520 --> 33:34.720
I invited you here today

717
33:34.720 --> 33:36.840
to ask for a favor.

718
33:38.440 --> 33:41.520
I sent Ali abroad when he was very young.

719
33:41.840 --> 33:44.360
He recently brought back

720
33:44.360 --> 33:46.840
a transnational new energy project.

721
33:46.840 --> 33:49.040
So I wanted you two to hear about it

722
33:49.160 --> 33:50.490
and help me check it out.

723
33:50.760 --> 33:51.840
Mr. Wan Jr.,

724
33:52.120 --> 33:53.850
please introduce the project.

725
33:54.240 --> 33:57.900
The core of this project is a liquid hydrogen compression system,

726
33:58.160 --> 34:00.280
which is a military-to-civilian technology.

727
34:00.280 --> 34:02.880
I was introduced to it

728
34:02.880 --> 34:04.160
by a foreign energy consultant.

729
34:04.160 --> 34:05.480
It's absolutely reliable.

730
34:05.480 --> 34:08.440
They are willing to authorize the use of some patents.

731
34:08.440 --> 34:10.639
Where is the other company registered?

732
34:11.000 --> 34:11.960
Because military-to-civilian technology

733
34:11.960 --> 34:13.600
involves national security reviews.

734
34:13.600 --> 34:15.929
Have the approval documents been issued?

735
34:17.159 --> 34:19.040
Lawyer Li, you're quite skeptical.

736
34:19.040 --> 34:21.639
Or do you think the project I brought back

737
34:21.840 --> 34:22.960
is unreliable?

738
34:24.320 --> 34:25.320
How could that be?

739
34:25.520 --> 34:26.360
Our Lawyer Li

740
34:26.360 --> 34:29.159
just has a rigorous working style.

741
34:29.560 --> 34:30.320
Don't worry.

742
34:30.840 --> 34:32.040
The qualifications are fine.

743
34:32.040 --> 34:33.120
I've already confirmed it.

744
34:33.120 --> 34:34.480
That's great.

745
34:34.639 --> 34:36.600
If we can secure this transnational cooperation,

746
34:36.600 --> 34:38.659
the market will open up immediately.

747
34:38.800 --> 34:39.280
Mr. Wan,

748
34:39.920 --> 34:41.679
no wonder you value him so much.

749
34:42.360 --> 34:43.440
They also said

750
34:44.040 --> 34:44.800
that in the entire Asian region,

751
34:44.800 --> 34:47.400
people are flocking to cooperate with them.

752
34:47.719 --> 34:50.400
After all, everyone is fighting for good projects.

753
34:50.400 --> 34:53.159
They value our solid industrial foundation at Wangang

754
34:53.159 --> 34:55.219
and really want to cooperate with us.

755
34:55.400 --> 34:56.159
No problem.

756
34:56.400 --> 34:58.680
Once Mr. Wan Jr. prepares and sends over the materials,

757
34:58.680 --> 35:01.480
we will definitely give feedback as soon as possible.

758
35:01.480 --> 35:02.760
Come on, let's eat.

759
35:02.760 --> 35:04.160
Ali, have some food.

760
35:08.320 --> 35:08.850
Grandma.

761
35:09.320 --> 35:11.650
We were worried, so we came to see Xiaoxue.

762
35:11.680 --> 35:13.640
You're so busy, yet you still came to see Xiaoxue.

763
35:13.640 --> 35:14.560
Thank you so much.

764
35:14.560 --> 35:15.760
No need to be so polite with us.

765
35:15.760 --> 35:17.800
It must be hard for you to stay with her all the time.

766
35:17.800 --> 35:18.520
Grandma.

767
35:18.800 --> 35:20.520
Can you help me wash these fruits?

768
35:20.520 --> 35:21.920
Then I can take you out for a walk.

769
35:21.920 --> 35:22.680
How about that?

770
35:22.680 --> 35:23.800
That sounds good.

771
35:23.800 --> 35:25.000
Yes, thank you.

772
35:25.000 --> 35:26.000
Don't mention it.

773
35:26.040 --> 35:26.880
Yes, it's what we should do.

774
35:26.880 --> 35:28.120
We'll take good care of Xiaoxue.

775
35:28.120 --> 35:29.280
Don't worry.

776
35:31.240 --> 35:32.920
Xiaoxue, don't be nervous.

777
35:33.040 --> 35:36.080
These two are my very good friends.

778
35:37.840 --> 35:40.080
This is Lawyer Xiao.

779
35:40.320 --> 35:42.240
I'm Luo Zhi.

780
35:42.680 --> 35:44.320
Her intern.

781
35:45.600 --> 35:49.600
We came to ask if you need our help.

782
35:55.400 --> 35:56.160
Xiaoxue.

783
35:58.920 --> 36:01.650
You didn't try to end your life because of a fight.

784
36:01.920 --> 36:02.600
Did you?

785
36:03.680 --> 36:04.360
Right?

786
36:09.040 --> 36:10.480
Don't be afraid.

787
36:10.560 --> 36:11.040
Yes.

788
36:11.320 --> 36:14.320
We won't hurt you.

789
36:20.240 --> 36:22.400
She said we can't help her.

790
36:26.480 --> 36:29.600
My parents are both deaf.

791
36:30.080 --> 36:32.120
They love to chat.

792
36:33.480 --> 36:36.120
But they are very quiet outside.

793
36:36.640 --> 36:39.800
When hearing people bully them, they don't dare to fight back.

794
36:39.800 --> 36:43.640
They feel they can't win an argument with hearing people.

795
36:44.200 --> 36:48.440
That's why I wanted to be a lawyer.

796
36:48.920 --> 36:51.240
I want to help them.

797
36:51.840 --> 36:55.720
Can you tell us what happened to you?

798
36:56.200 --> 36:58.880
We promise to listen carefully.

799
37:01.040 --> 37:01.880
Really?

800
37:02.160 --> 37:02.800
Really.

801
37:20.320 --> 37:23.160
She said she was bullied by Wei Dong.

802
37:26.640 --> 37:27.720
She is deaf.

803
37:29.400 --> 37:31.060
It's hard for her to find a job.

804
37:33.640 --> 37:36.520
She finally found a job at a hair salon.

805
37:37.400 --> 37:39.530
Wei Dong is a shareholder of the salon.

806
37:45.480 --> 37:46.480
Everyone thought

807
37:46.760 --> 37:49.160
that having someone so well-off pursue her

808
37:49.200 --> 37:50.460
was a blessing for her.

809
37:51.080 --> 37:53.880
That's why she decided to give Wei Dong a chance.

810
38:00.240 --> 38:01.000
Xiaoxue.

811
38:01.440 --> 38:01.970
Who is it?

812
38:02.280 --> 38:05.080
Wei Dong kept expressing his love for her.

813
38:06.000 --> 38:08.130
But she never felt like she was in love.

814
38:11.760 --> 38:13.020
The night before last,

815
38:13.720 --> 38:16.080
Feng Xue texted Wei Dong to break up.

816
38:17.120 --> 38:18.480
But Wei Dong said

817
38:19.400 --> 38:21.260
he wanted to see her one more time.

818
38:42.800 --> 38:44.080
I'm serious about you.

819
38:45.240 --> 38:46.280
I like you.

820
38:47.280 --> 38:48.720
We should be together.

821
38:48.880 --> 38:50.340
Why don't you understand?

822
39:09.200 --> 39:12.130
Xiaoxue, have you thought about calling the police?

823
39:16.880 --> 39:17.720
Weidong said

824
39:18.720 --> 39:21.050
since they are boyfriend and girlfriend,

825
39:21.480 --> 39:23.520
the police wouldn't care even if she called them.

826
39:23.520 --> 39:24.250
No, Xiaoxue.

827
39:24.560 --> 39:26.800
As long as he doesn't have your consent,

828
39:26.920 --> 39:28.450
he has no right to touch you.

829
39:28.640 --> 39:29.920
It's against the law.

830
39:30.160 --> 39:30.680
Right.

831
39:30.840 --> 39:32.300
Under any circumstances,

832
39:32.480 --> 39:34.160
no matter what your relationship is,

833
39:34.160 --> 39:35.320
going against your will

834
39:35.320 --> 39:36.320
is a crime.

835
39:36.840 --> 39:38.640
He should be punished by the law.

836
39:39.480 --> 39:40.120
Trust me.

837
39:40.200 --> 39:41.930
Don't be afraid of his threats.

838
39:42.160 --> 39:45.090
And don't believe the nonsense that no one will care.

839
39:45.720 --> 39:48.000
We will stand with you and protect you.

840
39:59.280 --> 40:00.040
Hello.

841
40:07.600 --> 40:08.560
Rape?

842
40:09.040 --> 40:10.600
How could I do such a thing?

843
40:10.680 --> 40:12.360
We are boyfriend and girlfriend.

844
40:12.360 --> 40:12.760
Well,

845
40:13.080 --> 40:15.480
isn't it normal to have sex?

846
40:15.600 --> 40:18.260
Do you remember how you expressed your refusal?

847
40:22.160 --> 40:23.600
She said she didn't agree

848
40:25.800 --> 40:27.040
and kept struggling,

849
40:28.040 --> 40:29.160
trying to run out,

850
40:31.040 --> 40:32.960
but Weidong dragged her back.

851
40:34.080 --> 40:36.210
Is it because I want to break up with her

852
40:36.440 --> 40:37.240
that she's angry

853
40:37.240 --> 40:38.320
and doing this to get back at me?

854
40:38.320 --> 40:39.360
You're breaking up?

855
40:39.360 --> 40:39.920
Yes.

856
40:40.800 --> 40:43.960
My parents are respectable people in society

857
40:44.520 --> 40:46.560
and have always had high expectations of me.

858
40:46.560 --> 40:48.120
So they can't accept

859
40:49.320 --> 40:51.450
a daughter-in-law with a disability.

860
40:53.400 --> 40:55.120
She was really scared at the time.

861
40:55.120 --> 40:56.400
She was afraid that Wei Dong would hurt her.

862
40:56.400 --> 40:58.800
I didn't agree.

863
40:59.480 --> 41:01.880
She kept begging me not to break up with her.

864
41:01.960 --> 41:03.420
I felt a bit soft-hearted.

865
41:04.160 --> 41:05.920
Then she initiated intimacy with me.

866
41:05.920 --> 41:06.580
And then...

867
41:07.240 --> 41:08.840
It just happened naturally.

868
41:25.160 --> 41:26.600
The video doesn't show what she claimed:

869
41:26.600 --> 41:29.120
her breaking free from Wei Dong and running out.

870
41:29.120 --> 41:29.520
She...

871
41:29.760 --> 41:30.960
Did she remember it wrong?

872
41:30.960 --> 41:33.400
There's no surveillance footage of you running away.

873
41:33.400 --> 41:36.400
Did you remember it wrong?

874
41:36.960 --> 41:39.480
The police said there's insufficient evidence for this case right now.

875
41:39.480 --> 41:40.800
We can't file a case yet.

876
41:40.800 --> 41:41.720
We need to investigate further.

877
41:41.720 --> 41:42.440
Xiaoxue.

878
41:42.840 --> 41:44.970
What are you doing? What are you doing?

879
41:46.080 --> 41:48.120
How could you frame me to the police?

880
41:48.360 --> 41:50.200
Don't you know what happened that day?

881
41:50.200 --> 41:51.960
Son. Son.

882
41:52.480 --> 41:54.680
Did they make things difficult for you?

883
41:54.960 --> 41:56.040
Since everyone is here,

884
41:56.040 --> 41:57.160
let me say something.

885
41:57.160 --> 41:59.760
Weidong, it's not too late to turn yourself in.

886
41:59.840 --> 42:01.640
Don't wait until the evidence is conclusive,

887
42:01.640 --> 42:02.480
or it will be too late for regrets.

888
42:02.480 --> 42:03.240
Comrade.

889
42:04.000 --> 42:05.320
I don't know who you are.

890
42:05.320 --> 42:06.080
I'm a lawyer.

891
42:06.320 --> 42:07.080
A lawyer?

892
42:07.080 --> 42:08.210
That's even better.

893
42:08.320 --> 42:09.680
From a legal perspective,

894
42:09.680 --> 42:11.600
there's the presumption of innocence, right?

895
42:11.600 --> 42:13.680
It's not appropriate for you to speak like that.

896
42:13.680 --> 42:15.000
Don't try to scare us.

897
42:15.200 --> 42:16.040
Our Weidong is

898
42:16.040 --> 42:17.240
an innocent boy.

899
42:17.320 --> 42:18.800
With our family's conditions,

900
42:18.800 --> 42:21.800
many good girls are throwing themselves at him.

901
42:21.800 --> 42:24.200
How could he have relations with a disabled person?

902
42:24.200 --> 42:25.400
How can you say that?

903
42:25.400 --> 42:26.840
Can you speak like a decent human being?

904
42:26.840 --> 42:27.600
You're a woman too.

905
42:27.600 --> 42:28.760
Don't you have any empathy?

906
42:28.760 --> 42:30.480
Can you teach your son to respect women?

907
42:30.480 --> 42:31.280
Say that again.

908
42:31.280 --> 42:32.280
Who are you? So what if I said it?

909
42:32.280 --> 42:32.640
That's enough.

910
42:32.640 --> 42:33.200
What are you doing?

911
42:33.200 --> 42:34.000
Stop arguing.

912
42:34.120 --> 42:35.360
Look where you are.

913
42:35.400 --> 42:36.640
Isn't this embarrassing enough?

914
42:36.640 --> 42:37.960
Let's go back.

915
42:38.040 --> 42:38.640
Well...

916
42:40.040 --> 42:40.720
Don't worry.

917
42:40.720 --> 42:41.680
Let me figure this out first.

918
42:41.680 --> 42:44.080
Think about it carefully.

919
42:44.440 --> 42:45.720
Stop asking.

920
42:46.440 --> 42:48.680
Xiaoxue, let's go home first.

921
42:49.080 --> 42:49.640
Let's go.

922
42:53.800 --> 42:55.600
Let Xiaoxue get some rest first.

923
42:55.800 --> 42:57.000
We'll figure something out.
